    },
    {
      "displayText": "皙白先生外出去了，\n但這對我來說是獲得了一個好機會。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7699767D5148751F591651FA53BB4E86FF0C000A4F4690195C0D62114F868AAA662F73725F974E864E00500B597D6A5F6703300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n雖然很唐突，但請和我對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A96D671365F8855107A81FF0C4F468ACB548C62115C0D6230FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想趁皙白先生不在的時候，\n重新檢視自己一番！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F38D817699767D5148751F4E0D5728768466425019FF0C000A91CD65B06AA2899681EA5DF14E00756AFF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要比試了，\n就告訴我一聲吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D89816BD48A664E86FF0C000A5C31544A8A3462114E0080725427FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要和我比試了嗎？\n還是要進行招式加強呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981548C62116BD48A664E8655CEFF1F000A9084662F89819032884C62DB5F0F52A05F375462FF1F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "招式加強……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DB5F0F52A05F37202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也有很多事要做。\n我能了解……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F67095F88591A4E8B8981505A3002000A621180FD4E8689E32026202600100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼我就向ZA登峰戰\nA級別的<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳討教一番了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC62115C315411005A0041767B5CF06230000A00417D1A5225768400100003110000FF01014F6059B38A0E65594E00756A4E86FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要和我比試了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981548C62116BD48A664E8655CEFF1F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n果然是密阿雷最強的訓練家。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F0010000201000000FF0C000A679C7136662F5BC6963F96F767005F3776848A137DF45BB6300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "相較之下，我實在是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F88F034E4B4E0BFF0C62115BE65728662F2026202600100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我……\n一點都沒有變強。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621120262026000A4E009EDE90FD6C9267098B8A5F37300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣下去正義社的聲譽……\n甚至連皙白先生的聲譽，都要被我拉低了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A234E0B53BB6B637FA9793E768480728B7D20262026000A751A81F390237699767D5148751F768480728B7DFF0C90FD898188AB621162C94F4E4E86300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我對正義社而言，\n有什麼存在價值嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C0D6B637FA9793E800C8A00FF0C000A67094EC09EBC5B58572850F9503C55CEFF1F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雄噢噢！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96C456625662FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕昂昂！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549566026602FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那傢伙們是流氓兄弟檔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A350A24F195011662F6D416C1351445F1F6A94FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠們是一對無視野生特區\n到處胡鬧的流氓熊貓。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72605011662F4E005C0D7121899691CE751F72795340000A5230865580E19B2776846D416C13718A8C93300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "連皙白先生也只能勉強趕走牠們，\n是很危險的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90237699767D5148751F4E5F53EA80FD52C95F378D958D7072605011FF0C000A662F5F88537196AA76845BF653EF5922300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但皙白先生不在的時候，\n守護這個道場就是我小種的職責。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F467699767D5148751F4E0D5728768466425019FF0C000A5B888B779019500B905358345C31662F62115C0F7A2E768480778CAC300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和我並肩戰鬥！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C62114E2680A962309B25FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n真是俐落！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A771F662F4FD0843DFF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雄喔？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96C45594FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "流氓熊貓，\n請從那邊退場吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D416C13718A8C93FF0C000A8ACB5F9E90A3908A900058345427300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皙白先生。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7699767D5148751F300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，還有小種。\n剛才那兩隻流氓熊貓是怎麼回事？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C908467095C0F7A2E3002000A525B624D90A3516996BB6D416C13718A8C93662F600E9EBC56DE4E8BFF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是！多虧有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>相助，\n才能趕走了來踢館的流氓兄弟檔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662FFF01591A86676709001000020100000076F852A9FF0C000A624D80FD8D958D704E864F868E22992876846D416C1351445F1F6A94300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她真不愧是密阿雷的救星，\n我有幸窺見了那份實力的冰山一角。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014ED65979771F4E0D6127662F5BC6963F96F776846551661FFF0C000A621167095E787ABA898B4E8690A34EFD5BE6529B768451B05C714E0089D2300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "相較之下，我實在是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F88F034E4B4E0BFF0C62115BE65728662F2026202600100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小種。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F7A2E300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "若沒有實力，\n是無法與<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>並肩作戰的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82E56C9267095BE6529BFF0C000A662F71216CD5820700100002010000004E2680A94F5C62307684300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到底，我能夠外出也是\n因為有小種妳守護著道場。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA52305E95FF0C621180FD5920591651FA4E5F662F000A56E070BA67095C0F7A2E59B35B888B77845790535834300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和強大的人比較後自愧弗如，\n這代表妳能瞭解彼我之間的差距。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C5F37592776844EBA6BD48F035F8C81EA61275F175982FF0C000A90194EE3886859B380FD77AD89E35F7C62114E4B959376845DEE8DDD300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小種妳會變得更強、更強的。\n下次和我一起趕走流氓熊貓吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F7A2E59B367038B8A5F9766F45F37300166F45F3776843002000A4E0B6B21548C62114E008D778D958D706D416C13718A8C935427300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662FFF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n今天真是謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4ECA5929771F662F8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF0100100002011400330000",
